<title>USA: International Remote Imaging Systems CFO.</title>
<headline>International Remote Imaging Systems CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Remote Imaging Systems Inc said on Tuesday that it has named Martin McDermut to the newly created post of vice president of finance and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Before joining IRIS, McDermut was CFO of Edudata Corp, which acquired Dental/Medical Diagnostic Systems in March 1996.</p>
<p>McDermut will take over the CFO position previously held by chairman, president and chief executive officer Fred Deindoerfer.</p>
